  "description": "UDUKOW crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4 2 m. Reported CIF formula moiety: C60 H72 Cl1 N4 O8 Yb4 1-,C16 H40 Na1 O8 1+. From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.354-3.354 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.98-95.98°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H112ClN4NaO16Yb4.",
